[{:db/id "q-10102/selection/31c8ea176c811c6864bb2b3b80a04c85203d966ef07396fc756dcb80349319a1" :answer/id #uuid "a66b9fd9-30c2-52c7-98f3-cb09d55a8e9f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=-5,y=8,z=-7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10102/selection/ed9dff81a26a60f35cc722686b8724a07d43e6a50a2d6f287826bba906a436f3" :answer/id #uuid "e1ef49ce-ebaa-5ef1-9a27-37da3f989153" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=-\\frac{5}{2},y=4,z=-\\frac{7}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10102/selection/5a10c6c87134f9a2ba7680382304c36b1d40b74c0d7e0a61c814c39613ac50ab" :answer/id #uuid "c678093b-aa73-555b-b056-7c362def00ab" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=5,y=8,z=-7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10102/selection/50fe46f175a613fc56f50ef873fd321a6aa620fda8ef4c5bd7d5c3574a9a1a4b" :answer/id #uuid "a496caee-0e84-52e6-9a1e-84aaa4a7e232" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\frac{5}{2},y=4,z=-\\frac{7}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10102/selection/03f97ab346c74177cb11c25fce43824e534b47518470025a9d89678b9ba79c7d" :answer/id #uuid "567483a4-8d5d-5829-8cd3-4512c59f9513" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\frac{5}{2},y=-4,z=-\\frac{7}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10102/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "b17aa334-95a3-5fed-9246-3dcdbe01c49d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-10102/selection/50fe46f175a613fc56f50ef873fd321a6aa620fda8ef4c5bd7d5c3574a9a1a4b" :answer-field/choices ["q-10102/selection/31c8ea176c811c6864bb2b3b80a04c85203d966ef07396fc756dcb80349319a1" "q-10102/selection/ed9dff81a26a60f35cc722686b8724a07d43e6a50a2d6f287826bba906a436f3" "q-10102/selection/5a10c6c87134f9a2ba7680382304c36b1d40b74c0d7e0a61c814c39613ac50ab" "q-10102/selection/50fe46f175a613fc56f50ef873fd321a6aa620fda8ef4c5bd7d5c3574a9a1a4b" "q-10102/selection/03f97ab346c74177cb11c25fce43824e534b47518470025a9d89678b9ba79c7d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-10102" :question/id #uuid "7cdfb00b-0ec5-5b97-84f5-0f56716105ba" :question/math-academy-id "q-10102" :question/problem "Solve the following system of linear equations by finding the inverse of the coefficient matrix:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}2y+2z=1 \\\\ x+y+z=3 \\\\ y+2z=-3\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "We wish to write this system in the form $Ax=b$, where $A$ is a $3\\times 3$ matrix and $x$ and $b$ are $3\\times 1$ column vectors. We can do this as follows:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNow, the solution to $Ax=b$ is given by $x={A}^{-1}b.$ So, we compute ${A}^{-1}$ as follows:\n\n*Step 1:*\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & =|\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =0|\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}|-2|\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{aligned}|+2|\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =0-2(2)+2(1) \\\\  & =-4+2 \\\\  & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n*Step 2:*\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =[\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}| & |\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{aligned}| & |\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}| & |\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{aligned}| & |\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}| & |\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}| & |\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}|\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n*Step 3:*\n\n$$\nC=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\n*Step 4:*\n\n$$\n{C}^{T}=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\n*Step 5:*\n\n$$\n{A}^{-1}=\\frac{1}{det(A)}{C}^{T}=-\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -2\\end{aligned}]=\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nHence\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{5}{2} \\\\ 4 \\\\ -\\frac{7}{2}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence the solution is $x=\\frac{5}{2},y=4,z=-\\frac{7}{2}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-10102/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4ad1721d-26a4-5459-bc81-297ff0e4d678"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-10102"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-78445/selection/eee46017f28706d8a739ee8d33b21621a284ac089bd08b305342f5c29667abf3" :answer/id #uuid "9e2e17be-9561-51ae-becd-6a6de9a2d231" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x={A}^{-1}\\,d\\,B" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-78445/selection/b7bfbfde50a91504394d1b413b591751c8a29ea1eefe3d2e7de9f4612e42e3a8" :answer/id #uuid "e6686259-76b5-5ceb-a5ef-72cce0cbf73a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x={B}^{-1}\\,d\\,{A}^{-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-78445/selection/bae2a82734d751af89897db18b0455820aece6c2275be3d10ee697c5e7869a83" :answer/id #uuid "876074ae-763b-53ee-91b5-462af323933c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x={A}^{-1}{B}^{-1}\\,d" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-78445/selection/228383024b3593d05de37eed2bb562e0d6a730857df66d9c3955eedff4ae2960" :answer/id #uuid "399b2205-9b7b-5bfd-945a-ef5eefeecb13" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=BA\\,d" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-78445/selection/c822a3635f9151eae99cc4f85624072a4ea0b574600ddb4dd37b274d1a11435c" :answer/id #uuid "d0b6a13b-2635-5dfd-9231-110608a8e0ca" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x={B}^{-1}{A}^{-1}\\,d" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-78445/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "6c8bfe68-6156-5af6-a3c1-c07ca6cc0947" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-78445/selection/c822a3635f9151eae99cc4f85624072a4ea0b574600ddb4dd37b274d1a11435c" :answer-field/choices ["q-78445/selection/eee46017f28706d8a739ee8d33b21621a284ac089bd08b305342f5c29667abf3" "q-78445/selection/b7bfbfde50a91504394d1b413b591751c8a29ea1eefe3d2e7de9f4612e42e3a8" "q-78445/selection/bae2a82734d751af89897db18b0455820aece6c2275be3d10ee697c5e7869a83" "q-78445/selection/228383024b3593d05de37eed2bb562e0d6a730857df66d9c3955eedff4ae2960" "q-78445/selection/c822a3635f9151eae99cc4f85624072a4ea0b574600ddb4dd37b274d1a11435c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-78445" :question/id #uuid "ecb9056c-9932-5a89-8f17-1df1e929dfe8" :question/math-academy-id "q-78445" :question/problem "Consider a matrix equation $AB\\,x=d,$ where $A$ and $B$ are $4\\times 4$ non-singular matrices, while $x$ and $d$ are $4\\times 1$ column vectors. Solve the equation for $x.$" :question/worked-solution "Since $A$ is not singular, it must have an inverse ${A}^{-1}.$ Now, pre-multiplying both sides of the equation $AB\\,x=d$ by ${A}^{-1},$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB\\,x & =d \\\\ {A}^{-1}AB\\,x & ={A}^{-1}\\,d \\\\ {I}_{4}B\\,x & ={A}^{-1}\\,d \\\\ B\\,x & ={A}^{-1}\\,d.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $B$ is not singular, it must have an inverse ${B}^{-1}.$ Now, pre-multiplying both sides of the equation $B\\,x={A}^{-1}\\,d$ by ${B}^{-1},$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B\\,x & ={A}^{-1}\\,d \\\\ {B}^{-1}B\\,x & ={B}^{-1}{A}^{-1}\\,d \\\\ {I}_{4}\\,x & ={B}^{-1}{A}^{-1}\\,d \\\\ x & ={B}^{-1}{A}^{-1}\\,d.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-78445/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5d0cda54-4a4b-5255-b375-ce5e7b604dff"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-78445"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-78555/selection/25666b67a56594dd5245ec05e89d883db07d04362ab51dbc90c39ad20f7f9142" :answer/id #uuid "271ccdef-55c9-5cd2-9341-32528cbed4ae" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-78555/selection/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer/id #uuid "dade19ea-899c-5f22-ab0b-f56bd2c25566" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-78555/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" :answer/id #uuid "5aaca2b1-a589-525d-9849-b5b3584b7ab3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-78555/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "ec731dd3-6cf7-5c80-b355-010517a42eff" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-78555/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "3bce034f-0376-586a-9ec5-6bef947db9b4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-78555/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "d1a59596-119a-5937-9d9d-686d733c76e5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-78555/selection/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer-field/choices ["q-78555/selection/25666b67a56594dd5245ec05e89d883db07d04362ab51dbc90c39ad20f7f9142" "q-78555/selection/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" "q-78555/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" "q-78555/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" "q-78555/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-78555" :question/id #uuid "a73bb8b3-8d6b-591a-b918-191402786b60" :question/math-academy-id "q-78555" :question/problem "Consider the following system of linear equations:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}-2x-y-z=3 \\\\ 6x-3y-5z=5 \\\\ 5x-y-2z=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system above has the matrix representation $Ax=b.$ Given that $x=⟨x,y,z⟩$ is unique, what is the value of $x+y+z?$ \n\n*Hint: The inverse of the coefficient matrix is given by*\n\n$$\n\\,{A}^{-1}=\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ -13 & 9 & -16 \\\\ 9 & -7 & 12\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write our system in matrix form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ax & =b \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}-2 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 6 & -3 & -5 \\\\ 5 & -1 & -2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nRecall that the solution to $Ax=b$ is given by $x={A}^{-1}b.$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ -13 & 9 & -16 \\\\ 9 & -7 & 12\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the solution is $x=0,y=-5,z=2.$\n\nFinally, $x+y+z=0+(-5)+2=-3.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-78555/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "12637b1d-ca03-568f-b1fc-6a626eec88de"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-78555"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-317900/field-1/7f0f2478ce521aa4000523fe155bfe972c7a8cc195da49dd5eb0249ef8194675" :answer/id #uuid "fbdaed99-aabc-5d6f-bd7e-29f69039b884" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "A" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317900/field-1/99effbe3b54b67baaeb34a2eb94e44b1dcbaf2c3b1f7559b7514b7